4
00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.407
Sí.

5
00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:08.008
Eh, no.

6
00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:08.842
No es nada.

7
00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:11.378
