21
00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.934
He oído eso

22
00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:35.168
tu

23
00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:36.136
ya estan casados?

24
00:00:36.203 --> 00:00:36.970
No lo soy.

25
00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:39.473
Eh, si,

26
00:00:39.473 --> 00:00:40.207
Estoy casado.

27
00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:41.642
Entonces tu,

28
00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:46.547
Ah, me duele la mano.
